Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ARM: Exynos4: Remove Samsung clock type support
Date: Mon,  1 Oct 2012 17:39:20 +0530
Message-Id: <1349093361-18820-2-git-send-email-thomas.abraham@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.9.5
